<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine telecom to end joint venture - agency.</title>
<headline>Argentine telecom to end joint venture - agency.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonica de Argentina will request government permission to end its long-distance joint-venture with Telecom de Argentina, the state Telam news agency said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Telam quoted a Telefonica spokesman saying his firm wanted to end its venture with Telecom in Telintar.</p>
<p>No Telefonica spokesman was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
